[4846]="70049623\n1\tTalk to Akhrûn\tYou should talk to Akhrûn.\n2\tTalk to Akhrûn\tAkhrûn can be found at the foothills near Naerband. You should speak with Akhrûn before she leaves for Nurn.\n",
[4847]="7000A2A7\n1\tCollect Satchel of Relics\tThe satchel of stolen pottery is somewhere in the Duskencleft, south-west of goblin-infested Tûm Fuin. Tûm Fuin is north of Ost Forod.\n2\tBring satchel of relics to Clark Standish\tClark Standish is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech, south of the Duskencleft. You have reclaimed the satchel of stolen relics and should return it to Clark Standish.\n",
[4848]="70071DFD\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai look-outs (total: 8)\030Defeat Ordâkhai sorceresses (total: 4)\030Defeat Ordâkhai champions (total: 2)\030Free Zajâni nobles (total: 5)\tDefeat Ordâkhai guards and free the Zajâni noble prisoners in the Hall of Lajór.\n2\tFind the final Zajâni noble prisoner\tFind the final Zajâni noble prisoner in the Hall of Lajór.\n3\tDefeat Nirjára Bóro in the Hall of Lajór\tDefeat Nirjára Bóro in the Hall of Lajór.\n4\tFree the final Zajâni noble prisoner\tFree the final Zajâni noble prisoner in the Hall of Lajór.\n",
[4849]="7002EE35\n1\tPatrol the first point\tIngmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale. You should patrol the first point for signs of the Enemy.\n2\tPatrol the second point\tIngmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale. You should patrol the second point for signs of the Enemy.\n3\tPatrol the third point\tIngmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale. You should patrol the third point for signs of the Enemy.\n4\tPatrol the fourth point\tIngmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale. You should patrol the fourth point for signs of the Enemy.\n5\tPatrol the final point\tIngmar has asked you to ride a patrol through the Entwash Vale. You should patrol the final point for signs of the Enemy.\n6\tTalk to Ingmar in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tIngmar is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should return to Ingmar with news of your success.\n",
[4850]="7002EE3D\n1\tPatrol the first point\tGóda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy. You should patrol the first point.\n2\tPatrol the second point\tGóda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy. You should patrol the second point.\n3\tPatrol the third point\tGóda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy. You should patrol the third point.\n4\tPatrol the fourth point\tGóda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy. You should patrol the fourth point.\n5\tPatrol the final point\tGóda has instructed you to make a patrol of the Entwash Vale to determine the strength of the Enemy. You should patrol the final point.\n6\tTalk to Góda in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tLady Góda is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale. You should return to Lady Góda with news of your success.\n",
[4851]="7004DA6B\n1\tCollect abandoned dwarf-made maces (total: 3)\030Collect abandoned dwarf-made swords (total: 3)\030Collect abandoned dwarf-made axes (total: 3)\tAbandoned dwarf-made axes, maces, and swords can be found in the lands surrounding Erebor. Bráthi has asked you to recover abandoned dwarf-made weapons from the lands surrounding Erebor.\n2\tDeliver the dwarf-make weapons to Bráthi\tBráthi can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have collected many dwarf-make weapons that were lost in the Battle of Dale, and you should now deliver them to Bráthi in Erebor.\n",
[4852]="7001A4A2\n1\tPlant banner at Fállug\tFállug lies to the south of Echad Sirion, overlooking the Anduin. Tethafnel has asked you to plant the banner of the Malledhrim at Fállug so their kindred in Lothlórien will know of their victory.\n2\tTalk to Tethafnel at Echad Sirion\tTethafnel is at Echad Sirion, north from Fállug. You should return to Tethafnel and let her know that you have planted the banner as she requested.\n",
[4853]="70071E8E\n1\tReach Esteemed standing with the Hamât Renewed\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n2\tSpeak to Lumgâna at Mizâdi's encampment\tAs Hamât rises anew, you have proven an invaluable ally. Mizâdi and her agents look to you for further assistance. You should return to Mizâdi's encampment and treat with Lumgâna.\n",
[4854]="70071E89\n1\tReach Esteemed standing with the Kintai of Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n2\tSpeak with Aralath at Sul Madásh\tYou honour the Kintai and assist them with the efforts to preserve Adagím. You should return to their settlement of Sul Madásh to speak with the quartermaster to be recognized for your efforts.\n",
[4855]="7003EE5C\n1\tOffer assistance to Melthindir\tMelthindir, a watcher of Esteldín, can be found at the eastern entrance to Esteldín. You should offer your aid to Melthindir.\n",
[4856]="70007033\n1\tBring the Ranger-troves back to Melthindir\030Collect Ranger-troves (total: 3)\tThe Rangers' supply troves are hidden throughout eastern Nan Amlug and Rhunenlad. In preparation for war, Melthindir is tasked with recovering the stores of weapons and supplies his predecessor hid. He has asked you to search Nan Amlug and Rhunenlad for these hidden stores. He only knows that these troves are hidden by rocks and trees.\n",
[4857]="700660B0\n1\tGather staunching herbs (total: 6)\030Gather anodyne herbs (total: 8)\tLogging is dangerous work, and a local healer wants to be prepared with medicinal herbs now that production is restarting. Gather herbs in the woods east of Ethring.\n2\tTalk to Nathiel\tBring the herbs you have gathered to Nathiel. Talk to Nathiel at the lumber camp east of Ethring.\n",
[4858]="7006BCF5\n1\tSpeak with Lieutenant Ovorestel at Ost Ringdyr\tMake your way to Ost Ringdyr to speak with Lieutenant Ovorestel. She is a guard there who helps in the construction and maintenance of weaponry used in battle across the Ettenmoors.\n2\tDefeat a monster player in the Ettenmoors\tLieutenant Ovorestel told you to go into the Ettenmoors and defeat a true enemy. Find an enemy out of Angmar that fights with fearsome tenacity and defeat them in battle to earn your reward.\n",
[4859]="7006BCF2\n1\tSpeak with Lieutenant Ovorestel at Ost Ringdyr\tMake your way to Ost Ringdyr to speak with Lieutenant Ovorestel. She is a guard there who helps in the construction and maintenance of weaponry used in battle across the Ettenmoors.\n2\tDefeat a monster player in the Ettenmoors\tLieutenant Ovorestel told you to go into the Ettenmoors and defeat a true enemy. Find an enemy out of Angmar that fights with fearsome tenacity and defeat them in battle to earn your reward.\n",
[4860]="7004E73E\n1\tComplete the Caverns of Thrumfall Instance. The Caverns of Thrumfall Instance can be found in the Instance Finder panel on the Specific tab under Non-Scaling Instance - Grey Mountains.\t\n2\tTalk to Agátur\tYou should talk to Agátur in Skarháld.\n",
[4861]="7002F93B\n1\tThe crofters can be found upon the plains and farmsteads south of the city of Cliving. The crofters need to be reassured that Reeve Athelward's orders must be followed, for their own safety.\t\n2\tTalk to Reeve Athelward at the Mead Hall of Cliving\tReeve Athelward resides at the Mead Hall at the east end of the city of Cliving. You have convinced several crofters to evacuate their homes and seek refuge from the White Hand invaders.\n",
[4862]="70070221\n1\tDefeat Heirsworn of Sûg Nidar and take their weapons (total: 8)\030Defeat Ordâkhai of Sûg Nidar and take their weapons (total: 8)\tRahâzi wants you to deprive the Corsairs and Ordâkhai of Sûg Nidar of their weapons.\n2\tTalk to Rahâzi at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch\tRahâzi asked to meet with you to the north-east of Fearwater Notch to dispose of the Heirsworn and Ordâkh weapons.\n3\tDispose of the weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch\tRahâzi asked you to dispose of the weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch.\n4\tDispose of more weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch\tRahâzi asked you to dispose of the weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch.\n5\tDispose of the rest of the weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch\tRahâzi asked you to dispose of the weapons at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch.\n6\tWave farewell to the weapons that can no longer be used by your enemies\tWave farewell to the weapons that can no longer be used by your enemies.\n7\tTalk to Rahâzi at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch\tRahâzi is at the shore north-east of Fearwater Notch, where you disposed of the weapons you gathered from your enemies.\n",
[4863]="7000C0AE\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Wardens of Annúminas.\n",
[4864]="7000C0AF\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Wardens of Annúminas.\n",
